---
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="Read the D10YLC website privacy approach and applicant-data safeguards."
>
  <PageIntro
    eyebrow="Privacy"
    title="Privacy"
    intro="This public website is designed to share information without collecting personal data."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="narrow prose">
      <h2>What this site collects</h2>
      <p>
        This version has no accounts, analytics, advertising, comments, or
        custom application form. Static hosting may generate limited technical
        request logs under the hosting provider’s policies.
      </p>

      <h2>Future membership forms</h2>
      <p>
        D10YLC will not add an application form until an adult data owner
        approves the fields, purpose, access, retention, correction and deletion
        process, and any parent or guardian consent. Responses will never be
        committed to this public website repository.
      </p>

      <h2>Youth safety</h2>
      <p>
        The site will not publish applicant data, private meeting links,
        attendance details, student contact information, or identifiable photos
        and quotes without documented approval and appropriate consent.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions or requests</h2>
      <p>
        The official privacy contact is pending verification. Once approved, it
        will appear on the <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
